name: sim.handleEmbeddedScripts
description: Lua only. Calls a specific system callback function in simulation scripts and customization scripts. Simulation- and customization scripts will be executed in a precise order. This function should only be called from the main script
pythonSynopsis: int scriptCount = sim.handleEmbeddedScripts(int callType)
inputs:
1. callType: desired system call type (e.g. sysCall_actuation)
outputs:
1. scriptCount: number of called scripts
replacedBy:
- name: handleSimulationScripts, class: scene, file: scene_handleSimulationScripts.method
